=== PEP 249 module globals ===
  apilevel     = '2.0'
  paramstyle   = 'qmark'  (? markers, same as CUBRIDdb)
  threadsafety = 1  (threads may share the module, not a connection)

=== Default: autocommit OFF ===
  conn.autocommit after connect: False
  inserted 1 row, no commit()
  same session COUNT(*):      1  (its own pending row)
  second connection COUNT(*): 0
  after rollback(), second connection COUNT(*): 0

=== Opt in: autocommit ON (the CUBRIDdb connect-time mode) ===
  conn.autocommit = True
  inserted 1 row, no commit()
  second connection COUNT(*): 1
  back to conn.autocommit = False

=== Cursor and connection closing ===
  inside 'with conn.cursor()': [('autocommitted',)]
  cursor after the with block: InterfaceError (Cursor is closed)

Dropped cookbook_cdb_connect
conn.cursor() after conn.close(): InterfaceError (connection is closed)
